[00:02.58](1 John 4:19)
[00:03.12]1. The pattern of love, we learn from Jehovah
[00:10.32]Shows the way, guides our way.
[00:17.10]In all he has done, his dealings have shown us
[00:23.82]How to display his loving way.
[00:31.02]He gave us his Son, his dearest possession
[00:37.46]To cover our sin, forgiving transgression.
[00:45.08]What proof of his love—its greatest expression!
[00:52.30]His way is love, Yes, God’s way is love.
[01:10.28]2. When we walk his way, our love for each other
[01:18.10]Will be true, warm and true,
[01:24.32]Will move us to care for all of our brothers,
[01:31.30]Old ones and new, not just a few.
[01:38.12]True love for our God and love for our brother,
[01:45.22]We can’t have the one and not have the other.
[01:51.76]The faults of our friends, we readily cover,
[01:59.12]Proving our love, Our brotherly love.
[02:06.96]3. The pattern of love, the bond that unites us
[02:07.92]Lets us be family.
[02:07.92]Our Father above now warmly invites us:
[02:07.92]“Come taste and see real unity.”
[02:47.92]Come share in the love and joy that define us;
[02:54.72]God’s spirit and Word, he gives to refine us.
[03:01.48]Our brothers and friends are here to remind us,
[03:09.10]God’s way is love. Jehovah is love.
